1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,307
We propose arimoclomol for laboratory testing in BUB one B
related mosaic variegated aneuploidy.

2
00:00:06,307 --> 00:00:10,869
The aim is better chromosome separation through
restoration of functional Bub R one.

3
00:00:10,869 --> 00:00:16,082
The key unknown is whether the N one thousand and two K
variant retains function that a drug can rescue.

4
00:00:16,082 --> 00:00:18,202
No drug rescue has been demonstrated.

5
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:27,055
Arimoclomol has a documented human exposure record and a
conditional stress-response rationale.

6
00:00:27,055 --> 00:00:31,986
N M N has stronger direct evidence of increased Bub R one
protein, in mouse systems.

7
00:00:31,986 --> 00:00:36,829
Four P B A can also increase inducible Hsp70 in a
different cell model.

8
00:00:36,829 --> 00:00:39,726
None establishes N one thousand and two K rescue.

9
00:00:39,726 --> 00:00:44,129
We would compare these candidates on function and cell
fate at qualified exposures.

10
00:00:44,129 --> 00:00:46,204
Another candidate can replace our lead.

11
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:53,748
First, compare full-length normal and variant protein at
matched abundance.

12
00:00:53,748 --> 00:00:57,635
Then measure segregation errors alongside division, death
and arrest.

13
00:00:57,635 --> 00:01:04,578
Confidence bounds must clear a prespecified worthwhile
benefit, with exposure and fate criteria also satisfied.

14
00:01:04,578 --> 00:01:07,361
A protein increase alone cannot advance the programme.

15
00:01:07,361 --> 00:01:11,611
The protocol includes construct specifications and public
price evidence.

16
00:01:11,611 --> 00:01:16,410
Laboratory acceptance, imaging qualification and the
complete budget remain open.

17
00:01:19,767 --> 00:01:23,106
Here are three recorded executions using synthetic inputs.

18
00:01:23,106 --> 00:01:29,790
In the first, protein rises forty percent, but the
functional interval stays below the illustrative benefit
threshold.

19
00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:32,264
The programme rules out that worthwhile benefit.

20
00:01:32,264 --> 00:01:37,357
In the second, the surviving cells look better, but
selective loss triggers do not advance.

21
00:01:37,357 --> 00:01:42,323
In the third, exposure measurement fails, so the result is
technically indeterminate.

22
00:01:42,323 --> 00:01:45,560
The intervals are supplied, not fitted from observations.

23
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:50,934
These examples demonstrate working decision software, not
experimental drug effects.

24
00:01:54,267 --> 00:01:58,306
The offline navigator shows the source behind a
gene-to-condition connection.

25
00:01:58,306 --> 00:02:00,428
This is the actual BUB one B lookup.

26
00:02:00,428 --> 00:02:05,072
Twenty-eight selected queries passed, covering forty-seven
reviewed associations.

27
00:02:05,072 --> 00:02:10,109
That developer audit shares the tool's sources, so
clinical validity remains untested.

28
00:02:10,109 --> 00:02:12,939
A match does not establish family eligibility.

29
00:02:12,939 --> 00:02:21,220
Separately, our public ranking benchmark retains all seven
hundred and thirteen signatures, failures and source
qualifications for inspection.

30
00:02:24,533 --> 00:02:33,392
The credit plan funds evidence checks, public validation
and reusable analysis tools, with an initial
service-qualification step and spending caps.

31
00:02:33,392 --> 00:02:41,040
Its outputs are corrected claim records, a new evaluation
registered before inference, and reproducible analysis
releases.

32
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:43,604
Credits do not fund the laboratory programme.

33
00:02:43,604 --> 00:02:49,214
What we deliver now is a testable drug proposal and
working tools that expose unsupported conclusions.

34
00:02:49,214 --> 00:02:54,195
The next biological result must determine which candidate,
if any, advances.
